findings.recommendation:
Add an always-on format-if-present check for TRIGGER_CUSTOM_FIELD_SET triggerValue on every save, matching the slug pattern already enforced for the trigger in the subscriber domain (^[a-z0-9_-]{1,32}$). Example:
  case TRIGGER_CUSTOM_FIELD_SET -> {
      trigger.setTriggerValue(formatFieldKeyIfPresent(dto.triggerValue()));
      // same pattern: null/blank passes (presence deferred to activate)
      // present value must match ^[a-z0-9_-]{1,32}$ (no dots, no Mongo operators)
  }
Also add an @Size(max=32) annotation to TriggerDto.triggerValue or, better, field-specific annotations per type.
